     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A** Client Log-In Transaction File                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  05/29/97  C:69  PROJ: SY010                                  *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  DESCRIPTION: Stores the detail information associated with   *
     A*               the signon access into the Client's AS/400.     *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  ##/##/##  C:##  PROJ: XXXXX                                  *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(SREFP)
     A          R PCL01                     TEXT('Client log-in transactions')
     A            CLMODE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Mode' 'for start' 'or end')
     A                                      TEXT('Mode: 1=Start 2=End')
     A            CLRSYS    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Remote' 'system')
     A            CLRMK        160
     A                                      COLHDG('Remark' 'line')
     A            CLPROJ    R               REFFLD(PROJ)
     A                                      COLHDG('Project' 'number')
     A            CLSEQ#    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('DARTS' 'support' 'seq #')
     A            CLSOUN    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Sign-on' 'user' 'name')
     A*** STANDARD INITIAL FIELDS **********************************
     A            CLIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial' 'date')
     A            CLITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial' 'time')
     A            CLIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial' 'user')
     A            CLIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial' 'program')
     A*** STANDARD MAINTENANCE FIELDS ******************************
     A            CLDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Last' 'maintained' 'date')
     A            CLTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Last' 'maintained' 'time')
     A            CLUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Last' 'maintained' 'user')
     A            CLPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Last' 'maintained' 'pgm')
